<!--
    Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Icon set: Material Symbols, Sharp style, outlined, weight 300 (Apache-2.0, info/LICENSE-material-symbols.txt). The
    Uncharted 4 menus carry almost no icons, only thin arrows and the button prompts, so the set is the lightest open
    one that reads at 20px. art/icons.py fetches the sources and prints these entries; the path data is the SVGs' own
    (drawn on a 0,-960 view box) and IconTemplate moves it down by 960.

    One geometry per role Playnite's chrome needs (Icon + role), plus the dropdown, submenu and check indicators and the
    game page icons, drawn by IconTemplate in the inherited foreground. Library is a compass (explore). IconMainMenu is
    this theme's own mark, drawn by hand: a thin ring around a compass needle. Nothing is taken from the game.

    Menu icons (main menu, game menu) keep Playnite's own glyphs, recolored by the palette.
-->
